Ahlrichs TZVP: triple zeta valence plus polarization (Gaussian keyword TZVP).
Primitives and coefficients as printed by Gaussian 16 (gfinput) for this keyword, converted by tools/basissets/g16_basis_dump.py; coefficients are in Gaussian's overlap normalization.
